{
  "name": "cursor-zh-localizer",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "description": "一个面向 macOS Cursor 的中文增强补丁，覆盖设置页、Agent 面板、模型菜单、审查页和常见悬浮提示。",
  "type": "commonjs",
  "bin": {
    "cursor-zh-localizer": "./patch-cursor-zh.js"
